#. be-green.header-subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:101
msgid "Install Free & Open Source Software"
msgstr "Nainstalujte slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver"

#. be-green.opt-free.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:103 i18n/en.yaml:115
msgid "Opt Free with FOSS Apps"
msgstr "Slobodne s aplikaciami FOSS"

#. be-green.opt-free.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:105
msgid "Install sustainable apps on any computer and operating system."
msgstr ""
"Nainstalujte udrzatelne aplikacie na akykolvek pocitac a operacny system."

#. be-green.set-free.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:107
msgid "Set Free with Old Hardware"
msgstr "Oslobodte stary hardver"

#. be-green.set-free.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:109
msgid "Vendors control and kill support for aging hardware, by design."
msgstr ""
"Dodavatelia kontroluju a ukoncuju podporu pre starnuci hardver, zo svojej "
"podstaty."

#. be-green.be-free.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:111 i18n/en.yaml:151
msgid "Be Free with New Hardware"
msgstr "Budte slobodni s novym hardverom"

#. be-green.be-free.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:113
msgid ""
"Hardware made for independent software can be used as long as one wants."
msgstr ""
"Hardver vyrobeny pre nezavisly softver sa da pouzivat tak dlho, ako clovek "
"chce."

#. be-green.opt-free-section.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:117
msgid ""
"Using Free & Open Source software applications gives users flexibility. You "
"can use older hardware for longer when you have control over software's "
"demands on resources. Switch programs when needed and choose software that "
"is more sustainable for users and for the environment."
msgstr ""
"Pouzivanie slobodnych a otvorenozdrojovych softverovych aplikacii dava "
"pouzivatelom flexibilitu. Starsi hardver mozete pouzivat dlhsie, ked mate "
"kontrolu nad narokmi softveru na zdroje."

#. be-green.opt-free-section.button
#: i18n/en.yaml:119
msgid "See All"
msgstr "Zobrazit vsetko"

#. be-green.opt-free-section.creators.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:121
msgid "KDE for Creators"
msgstr "KDE pre tvorcov"

#. be-green.opt-free-section.creators.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:123
msgid ""
"Creative software tools tailored for artists, designers, and media creators."
msgstr ""
"Kreativne softverove nastroje prisposobene pre umelcov, dizajnerov a tvorcov "
"medii."

#. be-green.opt-free-section.gamers.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:125
msgid "KDE for Gamers"
msgstr "KDE pre hracov"

#. be-green.opt-free-section.gamers.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:127
msgid ""
"Powerful gaming applications for an optimized and immersive gaming "
"experience."
msgstr "Vykonue herne aplikacie pre optimalizovany a pohlcujuci herny zazitok."

#. be-green.opt-free-section.students.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:129
msgid "KDE for Students"
msgstr "KDE pre studentov"

#. be-green.opt-free-section.students.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:131
msgid ""
"Educational software that provides flexible and user-friendly tools for "
"students."
msgstr ""
"Vzdelavaci softver poskytujuci flexibilne a pouzivatelsky privetiive "
"nastroje pre studentov."

#. be-green.set-free-section.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:133
msgid "Set Free Your Old Hardware"
msgstr "Oslobodte svoj stary hardver"

#. be-green.set-free-section.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:135
msgid ""
"Installing a Free & Open Source operating system takes just 3 steps and the "
"time needed to enjoy a couple cups of tea."
msgstr ""
"Instalacia slobodneho a otvorenozdrojoveho operacneho systemu trva iba 3 "
"kroky a cas potrebny na vychutnanie si niekolkych salok caju."

#. be-green.set-free-section.download-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:137
msgid "Download a FOSS Operating System"
msgstr "Stiahnite slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy operacny system"

#. be-green.set-free-section.download-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:139
msgid ""
"Download the FOSS operating system you want to install. For devices less "
"than 10 years old, Fedora Linux with KDE spin is our recommendation."
msgstr ""
"Stiahnite si slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy operacny system, ktory chcete "
"nainstalovat. Pre zariadenia mladsie ako 10 rokov je nasim odporucanim "
"Fedora Linux s KDE spin."

#. be-green.set-free-section.flash-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:141
msgid "Flash Operating System to a USB Stick"
msgstr "Nahrajte operacny system na USB kluc"

#. be-green.set-free-section.flash-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:143
msgid ""
"With one of several easy-to-use tools, flash the operating system to a USB "
"stick. This will overwrite all data on the USB stick, so make sure to back "
"up the files you want to keep."
msgstr ""
"Pomocou jedneho z niekolkych jednoduchych nastrojov nahrajte operacny system "
"na USB kluc. Tymto sa prepisu vsetky udaje na USB kluci, takze si zaloohujte "
"subory, ktore si chcete ponechat."

#. be-green.set-free-section.boot-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:145
msgid "Boot and Install on Computer"
msgstr "Spustite a nainstalujte na pocitaci"

#. be-green.set-free-section.boot-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:147
msgid ""
"Boot your computer from USB – you will need to know the correct keyboard "
"combination beforehand. Click \"Install\" and follow the instructions. "
"Voila! You have set your computer free. Make sure you have backed up any "
"data you want to keep first."
msgstr ""
"Spustite pocitac z USB -- budete musiet vopred poznat spravnu kombinaciu "
"klaves. Kliknite na \"Instalovat\" a postupujte podla pokynov. Voila! "
"Oslobodili ste svoj pocitac."

#. be-green.be-free-section.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:153
msgid ""
"KDE partners with several hardware providers to give the best experience out-"
"of-the-box. Because these devices support Free & Open Source Software, you "
"can use them however you want, for as long as you want. Support for "
"repairability is a focus for the recommended devices featured here!"
msgstr ""
"KDE spolupracuje s niekolkymi dodavatelmi hardveru na poskytnutie "
"najlepsieho zazitku hned po vybaleni. Kedze tieto zariadenia podporuju "
"slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver, mozete ich pouzivat ako chcete, ako "
"dlho chcete."

#. be-green.be-free-section.slimbook-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:155
msgid "Slimbook"
msgstr "Slimbook"

#. be-green.be-free-section.slimbook-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:157
msgid ""
"With a FOSS operating system pre-installed and a large catalog of spare "
"parts, your Slimbook can remain in use for years to come."
msgstr ""
"S predinstalovaanym slobodnym a otvorenozdrojovym operacnym systemom a "
"velkym katalogom nahradnych dielov moze vas Slimbook zostat v pouzivani na "
"roky dopredu."

#. be-green.be-free-section.slimbook-button
#: i18n/en.yaml:159 i18n/en.yaml:165
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Čítať viac"

#. be-green.be-free-section.framework-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:161
msgid "Framework"
msgstr "Framework"

#. be-green.be-free-section.framework-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:163
msgid ""
"By designing hardware to be modular and customizable, a Framework computer "
"is as easy to repair as snapping in a new part."
msgstr ""
"Dizajnovanim hardveru ako modularneho a prisposobitelneho je oprava pocitaca "
"Framework rovnako jednoducha ako zaklapnutie novej casti."

#. make-green.header-subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:169
msgid "Develop Energy-Efficient Free & Open Source Software"
msgstr "Vyvijajte energeticky efektivny slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver"

#. make-green.measure.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:171
msgid "Measure Software Energy Use"
msgstr "Merajte spotrebu energie softveru"

#. make-green.measure.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:173
msgid ""
"Free & Open Source Software has always been about transparency – let's "
"extend that transparency to software's energy demands."
msgstr ""
"Slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver bol vzdy o transparentnosti -- rozsirme "
"tuto transparentnost na energeticke naroky softveru."

#. make-green.read.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:177
msgid "Read the KDE Eco Handbook"
msgstr "KDE Eco"

#. make-green.read.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:179
msgid ""
"\"Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To Free Software\" details how to eco-"
"certify software and why it matters."
msgstr ""
"\"Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To Free Software\" podrobne opisuje, ako "
"ekocertifikovat softver a preco je to dolezite."

#. make-green.prepare.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:181 i18n/en.yaml:197
msgid "Prepare Scripts to Measure Energy Use"
msgstr "Pripravte skripty na meranie spotreby energie"

#. make-green.prepare.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:183
msgid ""
"Energy consumption measurements require a scripted and replicable workflow "
"of actions."
msgstr ""
"Merania spotreby energie vyzaduju skriptovany a replikovatelny pracovny "
"postup akcii."

#. make-green.measure-section.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:185
msgid "Measure Your Software's Energy Use"
msgstr "Merajte spotrebu energie vasho softveru"

#. make-green.measure-section.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:187
msgid ""
"Setting up a lab is as easy as buying an external power meter and following "
"the lab setup guide in the KDE Eco handbook. KEcoLab makes the process even "
"easier by enabling developers to remotely measure the energy consumption of "
"their software using GitLab's CI/CD pipeline. What's more, at the end of the "
"measurement process you will have an energy consumption report ready for "
"Blue Angel eco certification."
msgstr ""
"Zriadenie laboratoria je take jednoduche, ako kupit externy merac spotreby a "
"nasledovat sprievodcu nastavenim laboratoria v prirucke KDE Eco. KEcoLab "
"proces este viac zjednodusuje umoznenim vyvojarom dalkovo merat spotrebu "
"energie ich softveru pomocou CI/CD pipeline GitLab."

#. make-green.measure-section.button
#: i18n/en.yaml:189 i18n/en.yaml:201
msgid "View Repository"
msgstr "Zobrazit repozitar"

#. make-green.handbook.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:191
msgid "Use the KDE Eco Handbook"
msgstr "KDE Eco"

#. make-green.handbook.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:193
msgid ""
"The handbook \"Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To Free Software\" gives an "
"overview of the environmental harm driven by software and how the Blue Angel "
"ecolabel — the official environmental label of the German government — "
"provides a benchmark for sustainable software design. Learn how Free & Open "
"Source Software's values of transparency and user autonomy foster "
"sustainability, as well as how to set up a dedicated lab to measure your "
"software's energy consumption."
msgstr ""
"Prirucka \"Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To Free Software\" podava "
"prehlad o skodach na zivotnom prostredi sposobenych softverom a o tom, ako "
"ekoznacka Blue Angel -- oficialna environmentalna znacka nemeckej vlady -- "
"poskytuje referency bod pre udrzatelny dizajn softveru."

#. make-green.script-section.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:199
msgid ""
"Emulate user behavior for easy replication of your measurements. That's good "
"science! KdeEcoTest and KdeEcoTestCreator are Python-based tools designed "
"for reproducing computer actions by simulating keyboard and mouse activity. "
"The tools work on GNU/Linux and Microsoft Windows."
msgstr ""
"Emulujte spravanie pouzivatela pre jednoduchu replikaciu vasich merani. To "
"je dobra veda! KdeEcoTest a KdeEcoTestCreator su nastroje na baze Pythonu "
"urcene na reprodukciu pocitacovych akcii simulovanim aktivity klavesnice a "
"mysi."

#. make-green.past-projects-section.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:203
msgid "Past Projects"
msgstr "Minule projekty"

#. make-green.past-projects-section.sustainable-goal.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:205
msgid "KDE's Sustainable Software Goal"
msgstr "Ciel udrzatelneho softveru KDE"

#. endof10.text
#: i18n/en.yaml:211
msgid ""
"Continue using your old computer after the end of Windows 10 support this "
"October."
msgstr ""
"Pokracujte v pouzivani svojho stareho pocitaca po skonceni podpory Windows "
"10 v oktobri."

